␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Î#␀8ñ␀␀d␀␀#␀äÖá(() => clearInterval(interval)`␀␀Ïd␀ğ8ğ␀␀Å␀Âöb␀␀Å(äÆá7Õ() => {
    let interval;
    if (animating) {
      interval = setInterval(() => {
        setTurns((t) => (t + 0.01) % 1);
        setScale((s) => {
          const newScale = s + 0.01;
          return newScale > 1.5 ? 0.5 : newScale;
        });
        setOffset((o) => {
          let newDx = o.dx + 0.01;
          if (newDx > 0.5) newDx = -0.5;
          return { dx: newDx, dy: 0 };
        });
      }, 16);
    }
    return () => clearInterval(interval);
  }B
